# The two image builds need only the package's own inputs: bench/Dockerfile copies
# pyproject.toml + src/, and orchestration/Dockerfile also reads uv.lock for its frozen
# install and bakes the three deep-config files the registered knob-sweep reads on the worker
# (model.yaml, the sweep grid, the vLLM redeploy manifest). Everything else — terraform state,
# the rest of the cluster manifests, docs, git, caches, results — stays out of the build context
# so it can't bloat or leak into a layer. The three config files are named individually, not by
# their directories, so bench/ and k8s/ otherwise stay excluded.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!model.yaml
!bench/sweep-grid.yaml
!k8s/vllm-gpu.yaml
